            "value": "Xu, K., He, J., Chen, S., He, Y., Abadi, S., Rotundu, C., Lee, Y., Lu, D., Guo, Q., Tjernberg, O., Devereaux, T., Lee, D., Hashimoto, M., and Shen, Z. (2023). Anomalous normal state gap in an electron-doped cuprate . Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/ct843nw2177. https://doi.org/10.25740/ct843nw2177.",
